gui.autoeat.lookdown.tip.title=§e Instructions for eating with your head down
gui.autoeat.lookdown.tip.line1=§7 In some scenes, you will continue to right-click the interactive block, making it impossible to eat.
gui.autoeat.lookdown.tip.line2=§7 will lower its head when eating when turned on, improving the success rate.
gui.autoeat.smooth.tip.title=§e Smooth bowing instructions
gui.autoeat.smooth.tip.line1=After §7 is turned on, the angle of view will be gradually lowered according to smooth steering during the process of lowering the head.
gui.autoeat.smooth.tip.line2=§7 This can reduce the momentary head shaking and get closer to the smooth feel of the killing aura.
gui.autoeat.pathing.tip.title=§e Instructions for eating during the pathfinding period
gui.autoeat.pathing.tip.line1=§7 will only trigger automatic feeding when the path sequence is running and the current step is pathfinding.
gui.autoeat.pathing.tip.line2=§7 will not take the initiative to eat during the action phase, hanging on the spot, or standing normally.
gui.autoeat.pathing.tip.line3=After §7 has started eating, it will continue until the meal is confirmed and then resume the original process.
gui.autoeat.tip.validate.title=§e Instant verification
gui.autoeat.tip.threshold.range=§7 Input range: 0-20
gui.autoeat.tip.hotbar.range=§7 Input range: 1-9
gui.autoeat.tip.validate.common=§7 will be automatically corrected to the legal range when saved.
gui.autoeat.tip.keyword.title=§eKeyword priority
gui.autoeat.tip.keyword.line1=§7The priority decreases from left to right.
gui.autoeat.tip.keyword.line2=§7Default: steak, bread, apple, cookie
gui.autoeat.tip.keyword.line3=§7Only food matching the keyword will be automatically eaten.
